config BR2_PACKAGE_XMNPU_MODELS
	bool "xmnpu-models"
	default n
	help
	  YOLOv8n and YOLOv8s object detectors (people, vehicles, cats, dogs)
	  compiled for the GK7205V5x0 NPU, for majestic's npuDetect. Installed
	  into the NAND (UBIFS) rootfs only: they do not fit a NOR image.
	  AGPL-3.0, from the Ultralytics weights.

	  https://github.com/OpenIPC/xmnpu-models
